What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/1d84000.ufshc/ufs_transmission_status
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	OnePlus kernel team
Description:
		Read/write UFS transmission telemetry used by the OnePlus Midas
		performance stack. Reading reports enable state, sector totals,
		active time per low/high UFS gear, and SCSI/device-command counts.
		Writing zero disables collection and clears all counters; writing
		a non-zero value enables collection.
